                  <span className="text-neutral-300 font-medium">Terminal Response Output</span>
                  <span className="text-[10px] text-emerald-400 bg-emerald-500/10 border border-emerald-500/20 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded font-mono">
                    HTTP 200 OK
